ECMA-376 reference material
===========================

The files in this directory are copied from, or derived from, ECMA-376
"Office Open XML File Formats", 5th edition (December 2016), Parts 1 and 4,
published by Ecma International:
https://ecma-international.org/publications-and-standards/standards/ecma-376/

So are these tables in the source, which the packages bundle:

- packages/ooxml-core/src/drawingml-preset-geometry.generated.ts, the preset
  shape geometry, generated from part1/drawingml-geometries.
- packages/ooxml-core/src/drawingml-preset-colors.ts, the preset color names
  of ST_PresetColorVal (Part 1, 20.1.10.48).
- packages/core/src/store/formula/predefined-functions.generated.ts, the
  predefined function names, generated from part1/predefined-functions.txt.
  That file lists the names of the predefined functions of Part 1, 18.17.7.1
  to 18.17.7.356, taken from the table of contents, and no other text of the
  standard.
- packages/core/src/store/number-format/builtins.ts, the built-in number
  format codes of Part 1, 18.8.30.
- packages/core/src/cascade/color.ts and
  packages/core/src/store/number-format/parse.ts, the default indexed color
  palette of Part 1, 18.8.27.

These tables are not EigenPal code, and the Apache License of this repository
does not apply to them. The rest of each file that holds a table is EigenPal
code. The tables are used under the Ecma copyright notice below. They are
permitted derivative works under item (iv): they implement the functionality of
the standard in a conformant product. The copied files are not modified.

